{"unit_id":"zhangjunjesse__dsh-claude-code#card-zh","repo":"zhangjunjesse/dsh-claude-code","commit":"663f802ea19ba8111644aa116e7a013552c03812","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-claude-code 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的开发工具插件，可把完整且边界清楚的编码子任务交给本机 Claude Code，通过官方 Claude Agent SDK 调用并将结果返回 DSH。它注册 claude_code 与 claude_code_usage 两个工具，支持按会话续接、后台异步运行、结构化输出、成本预算和自定义 subagents；另提供 Claude Code 会话监控标签页，查看任务状态、实时输出和订阅额度。适合需要把独立开发工作交给另一个编码 agent，或希望跟踪长时间任务的 DSH 用户。需要本机 Claude CLI 和有效订阅登录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:28-34"]}
{"unit_id":"zhangjunjesse__dsh-claude-code#card-en","repo":"zhangjunjesse/dsh-claude-code","commit":"663f802ea19ba8111644aa116e7a013552c03812","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-claude-code delegates scoped coding tasks from the DSH web client to local Claude Code through the Agent SDK. It supports session resume, background jobs and structured results; a conversation tab shows task status and live output. A signed-in local Claude CLI subscription is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:28-34"]}
